 every equipment). They cover only the months read from the log so far: a month not read yet is left out, not counted as missed, and a job that reaches into a month not read yet (a quarterly or annual job, the first week of the year or of the months on screen) counts only once it is done. Read year to date also reads the December before the year, where the first week of the year starts.</p>
